  "releaseNotes": "- LINQ002 (ToListToArrayDelete): foreachループ本体が列挙元コレクション自体をRemove/Add等で変更している場合、.ToList()/.ToArray()を誤って不要と判定しFixで削除してしまう不具合を修正（削除すると列挙中の変更でInvalidOperationExceptionが発生する）\n      - Fix LINQ002 (ToListToArrayDelete) incorrectly flagging and removing a .ToList()/.ToArray() call whose corresponding foreach loop body mutates the original source collection (e.g. via Remove/Add); removing it would cause a runtime InvalidOperationException from mutating a collection during enumeration",
